Written for Hagistack.

openstack-neutron-ml2 installs the configuration of Neutron's Modular Layer 2
(ML2) core plugin and its agents' samples:

  /etc/neutron/plugins/ml2/ml2_conf.ini     ML2 plugin, including the [ovn]
                                            settings of the OVN driver
  /etc/neutron/plugins/ml2/ovn_agent.ini    neutron-ovn-agent
  /etc/neutron/plugins/ml2/sriov_agent.ini  neutron-sriov-nic-agent

The files are generated from the upstream option definitions with
oslo-config-generator; every option is commented out with its default.
The neutron-rpc-server, neutron-periodic-workers and
neutron-ovn-maintenance-worker units read ml2_conf.ini after neutron.conf.
/etc/neutron/ovn.ini (in openstack-neutron-common) is a link to ml2_conf.ini.
